#. module: pos_vrp2
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pos_vrp2/models/pos_order.py:0
msgid ""
"Order %(order)s was invoiced, so VRP2 holds an invoice payment for it, not a"
" sale. Cancel that payment receipt rather than returning items against it."
msgstr ""
"Objednávka %(order)s byla vyfakturována, takže VRP2 k ní eviduje úhradu "
"faktury, nikoli prodej. Místo vracení položek proti tomuto dokladu stornujte"
" doklad o úhradě."

#. module: pos_vrp2
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pos_vrp2/models/pos_order.py:0
msgid ""
"Order %(order)s was paid %(paid)s but its VRP2 receipt totals %(total)s; the"
" difference is too large to be tax rounding."
msgstr ""
"Objednávka %(order)s byla zaplacena částkou %(paid)s, ale její doklad VRP2 "
"zní na %(total)s; rozdíl je příliš velký na to, aby šlo o zaokrouhlení daně."

#. module: pos_vrp2
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pos_vrp2/models/pos_order.py:0
msgid ""
"Order %(order)s was paid more by non-cash means (%(non_cash)s) than it costs"
" (%(total)s) and also in cash; that cannot be put on a receipt."
msgstr ""
"Objednávka %(order)s byla bezhotovostně zaplacena více (%(non_cash)s), než "
"činí její cena (%(total)s), a navíc i v hotovosti; to nelze uvést na doklad."

#. module: pos_vrp2
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pos_vrp2/models/pos_order.py:0
msgid ""
"Order %(order)s was paid more by non-cash means than it costs and also in "
"cash; that cannot be put on a receipt."
msgstr ""
"Objednávka %(order)s byla bezhotovostně zaplacena více, než činí její cena, "
"a navíc i v hotovosti; to nelze uvést na doklad."

#. module: pos_vrp2
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pos_vrp2/models/pos_order.py:0
msgid ""
"Order %(order)s, which this refund returns goods from, has no VRP2 receipt "
"to reference. Fiscalize it first."
msgstr ""
"Objednávka %(order)s, ze které tato refundace vrací zboží, nemá doklad VRP2,"
" na který by bylo možné odkázat. Nejprve ji fiskalizujte."

#. module: pos_vrp2
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pos_vrp2/models/pos_order.py:0
msgid "Order %s has no lines to fiscalize."
msgstr "Objednávka %s nemá žádné řádky k fiskalizaci."

#. module: pos_vrp2
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pos_vrp2/models/pos_order.py:0
msgid "Order %s is already fiscalized in VRP2."
msgstr "Objednávka %s je již ve VRP2 fiskalizována."

#. module: pos_vrp2
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pos_vrp2/models/pos_order.py:0
msgid ""
"Order %s is an invoiced refund. A credit note is not fiscalized as an "
"invoice payment; cancel the original payment receipt instead."
msgstr ""
"Objednávka %s je vyfakturovaná refundace. Dobropis se nefiskalizuje jako "
"úhrada faktury; místo toho stornujte původní doklad o úhradě."

#. module: pos_vrp2
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pos_vrp2/models/pos_order.py:0
msgid "Order %s must be paid before it can be fiscalized."
msgstr "Objednávka %s musí být před fiskalizací zaplacena."

#. module: pos_vrp2
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pos_vrp2/models/pos_order.py:0
msgid ""
"Order line '%(line)s' carries taxes VRP2 cannot express: a receipt item has "
"exactly one percentage VAT rate."
msgstr ""
"Řádek objednávky „%(line)s“ obsahuje daně, které VRP2 nedokáže vyjádřit: "
"položka dokladu má právě jednu procentní sazbu DPH."

#. module: pos_vrp2
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pos_vrp2/models/pos_order.py:0
msgid ""
"Order line '%(line)s' has VAT %(rate)s %%, which is not a VRP2 VAT rate "
"(%(allowed)s)."
msgstr ""
"Řádek objednávky „%(line)s“ má DPH %(rate)s %%, což není sazba DPH VRP2 "
"(%(allowed)s)."

